# Dead code

Delete a symbol only when nothing in the repository reads it.

Keep an export that is a table or a public constant, even when nothing selects it today. `MAIN_MENU_TEXTS_DE` is the menu captions for language `D`. `CursorMode`, the work-buffer sizes, and `GlobalKind` stay.

An unused constant that described a cap the code never enforced is deleted. The check is not added. `addAnimaEffect` does not stop at 30 because `ANIMA_EFFECTS_MAX` used to say 30. The sentence in the method comment stays.

```ts
// Wrong: drop the German menu table because no caller passes "D" yet.
// Wrong: if (effects.length >= 30) return;

// Right: IDLE_FRAMES goes when IDLE_LIMIT is the live threshold.
// The comment on idleChoice points at scene/player-jack.ts.
```
